# Shared Contracts

- `src/shared` is the source of truth for models used by more than one process or subsystem.
- Add or update IPC payloads, settings shapes, user/session models, and build-config helpers here before duplicating types elsewhere.
- Keep these modules environment-neutral: no DOM APIs, React imports, Electron imports, or renderer-only helpers.
- Prefer stable, descriptive interfaces and union types so both main and renderer can rely on the same contract.
- When changing a shared type, update all affected main, preload, and renderer call sites in the same change.
